 999→// LookupSessionLog is a convenience function that opens the repository and retrieves
1000→// a session log by checkpoint ID. This is the primary entry point for callers that
1001→// don't already have a GitStore instance.
1002→// Returns ErrCheckpointNotFound if the checkpoint doesn't exist.
1003→// Returns ErrNoTranscript if the checkpoint exists but has no transcript.
1004→func LookupSessionLog(ctx context.Context, cpID id.CheckpointID) ([]byte, string, error) {
