124→// AsPromptExtractor returns the agent as PromptExtractor if it both implements
125→// the interface and (for CapabilityDeclarer agents) has declared TranscriptAnalyzer.
126→// ExtractPrompts is conceptually part of transcript analysis, so it shares the same
127→// capability gate — this prevents calling extract-prompts on external agent binaries
